{
  "title": "Oil Free Kenyan Chicken Salad",
  "description": "A light and refreshing Kenyan dish featuring grilled chicken, mixed greens, and a zesty vinaigrette dressing, perfect for a quick and healthy meal. This salad is also anti-inflammatory friendly.",
  "cuisine": "Kenyan",
  "diet": [
